Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a dba combination over the stable pool1 to see if iterative reweighting improves on trimmed_mean baseline.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the inverse-error weights (w2) on the broad pool4 to see if the weighted average improves over trimmed_mean and best_single.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ETS","THETA","rf","CWT_rf","DWT_rf","FT_rf"],"weights":"w2"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool5 to see if adding ETS/THETA/rf improves over best_single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool5"}

